1	# Data Model: Authentication and User Onboarding
2	
3	**Phase**: 1 | **Branch**: `001-auth-onboarding`
4	
5	## Domain Entities
6	
7	### User (Aggregate Root)
8	
9	Represents a person who can sign in. Administrators and standard users are distinguished by
10	`SystemRole`. The Google subject identifier (`google_sub`) is the stable identity — not the
11	email — so that a Google email change does not break sign-in.
12	
13	```csharp
14	public sealed class User
15	{
16	    public Guid Id { get; }
17	    public string Email { get; }
18	    public string DisplayName { get; }
19	    public SystemRole SystemRole { get; }
20	    public string? GoogleSub { get; private set; }      // null until first sign-in
21	    public DateTimeOffset RegisteredAt { get; }
22	    public DateTimeOffset? LastSignInAt { get; private set; }
